      o: ['每一家都一定要拜自己的祖先', '每個家庭有自己的事不必干涉別人', '祖先是家裡最重要的長輩', '長大以後要常常回家陪家人'], oen: ['Every family must worship its own ancestors', 'Each family has its own affairs — don\'t interfere with others\'', 'Ancestors are the most important elders in a family', 'You should visit family often once grown up'],
