      o: ['在山上不可以大聲說話吵到別人', '自己態度不好別人回應也不會好', '爬山很累所以要先休息再喊', '在山上喊話一定會聽到回音'], oen: ['Loud talking isn\'t allowed on a mountain', 'How you treat others is how they\'ll treat you back', 'Climbing is tiring, so rest before shouting', 'Shouting on a mountain always gets an echo'],
