      o: ["田螺冬天會躲進泥土裡面睡覺", "忍耐一下,等待好時機再出頭", "冬天的時候要多喝一點水", "過冬要準備足夠的糧食"], oen: ['Snails burrow into mud to sleep in winter', 'Be patient and wait for the right moment', 'Drink more water in winter', 'You must stock enough food for winter'],
