      o: ["抓到烏龜卻讓鱉跑掉,顧此失彼", "烏龜和鱉都很會跑,很難抓到", "抓烏龜的時候要小心不要被咬", "想抓什麼就要專心只抓一種"], oen: ['Catch the turtle but let the terrapin escape — you can\'t have both', 'Both turtles and terrapins are hard to catch', 'Be careful not to get bitten catching a turtle', 'Focus on catching just one kind of animal'],
