      o: ["鴨子聽到打雷聲會嚇得亂跑", "完全聽不懂別人在說什麼", "聽到很大的聲音就會很害怕", "很喜歡在下雨天出來散步"], oen: ['A duck panics and runs at the sound of thunder', 'Someone who has absolutely no idea what\'s being said', 'Loud noises always frighten people', 'Someone who loves walking in the rain'],
