      o: ["青蛙的肉很少,不值得殺來吃", "愛吹牛的人其實沒有真本事", "水雞是一種很會游泳的動物", "殺雞之前要先把雞餵得很肥"], oen: ['Frogs have so little meat they\'re not worth cooking', 'A boastful person actually has no real skill', 'A water frog is a great swimmer', 'Chickens must be fattened before being killed'],
