      o: ["手骨斷掉要趕快去看醫生", "遇到挫折之後反而變得更堅強", "打架的時候手會很容易受傷", "手骨很硬的人打起來很厲害"], oen: ['See a doctor right away if you break a bone', 'Setbacks can actually make you stronger', 'Arms break easily in a fight', 'People with hard bones fight well'],
